RewardSkip adds:
  - instant skip mode (fire the full reward callback sequence)
  - delayed ~5s skip mode (lower-detection option)
  - AppLovin MAX, Unity LevelPlay and Mintegral hooks
  - a documented mode interface for external controllers (e.g. RamGuard)
  - renamed package and project identity

